msgid ""
"The RiverCure Portal (RCP) combines geographic data, sensors and "
"hydrodynamic modeling tools to manage flood risk. The RCP utilizes both "
"crowdsourced and authoritative data, including sensor outputs and virtual "
"data sources."
msgstr ""

#: rivercureportal/templates/rivercureportal/about.html:78
#: rivercureportal/templates/rivercureportal/about.html:226
msgid ""
"RiverCure reduces uncertainty and improves forecasting in flood simulation, "
"water management, and habitat protection models."
msgstr ""

