#: rivercureportal/templates/rivercureportal/about.html:111
#: rivercureportal/templates/rivercureportal/about.html:264
msgid "How does it work?"
msgstr ""

#: rivercureportal/templates/rivercureportal/about.html:131
#: rivercureportal/templates/rivercureportal/about.html:279
msgid "What is a Context?"
msgstr ""

#: rivercureportal/templates/rivercureportal/about.html:137
#: rivercureportal/templates/rivercureportal/about.html:285
msgid ""
"A Context, or geographic Context, refers to a specific geographic area, "
"relevant to modeling and analyzing flood events. Each Context is defined by "
"a name, sensors, and a set of geographic characteristics."
msgstr ""

#: rivercureportal/templates/rivercureportal/about.html:147
#: rivercureportal/templates/rivercureportal/about.html:295
msgid "What is a Contribution?"
msgstr ""

#: rivercureportal/templates/rivercureportal/about.html:153
#: rivercureportal/templates/rivercureportal/about.html:301
msgid ""
"A Contribution is a set of information contributed by the user, regarding a "
"real-life situation they have observed."
msgstr ""

#: rivercureportal/templates/rivercureportal/about.html:163
#: rivercureportal/templates/rivercureportal/about.html:311
msgid "What is an Event?"
msgstr ""

#: rivercureportal/templates/rivercureportal/about.html:169
#: rivercureportal/templates/rivercureportal/about.html:317
msgid ""
"An Event is a real or simulated set of occurrences, taken place during a "
"given period, in a given geographic area."
msgstr ""

#: rivercureportal/templates/rivercureportal/about.html:179
#: rivercureportal/templates/rivercureportal/about.html:327
msgid "What is a Quiz?"
msgstr ""

#: rivercureportal/templates/rivercureportal/about.html:185
#: rivercureportal/templates/rivercureportal/about.html:333
msgid ""
"A Quiz is a set of questions that can be answered by the user. Quizzes can "
"be available only to the members of the Organization that created it, or to "
"the entire RCP community (Public Quizzes)."
msgstr ""

#: rivercureportal/templates/rivercureportal/about.html:195
#: rivercureportal/templates/rivercureportal/about.html:343
msgid ""
"I want to contribute to a Context that does not exist in the RiverCure "
"Portal. What should I do?"
